t":"unlabeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2020-10-25T22:50:30Z","label":{"name":"needs triage","color":"5ce8b7"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":3918316198,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDM5MTgzMTYxOTg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/events/3918316198","actor":{"login":"AquilesCanta","id":8539544,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1Mzk1NDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8539544?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta","html_url":"https://github.com/AquilesCanta","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2020-10-25T22:50:30Z","label":{"name":"bug: in dependency","color":"e99695"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/716228356","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7983#issuecomment-716228356","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7983","id":716228356,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcxNjIyODM1Ng==","user":{"login":"Stonos","id":42659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNjU5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos","html_url":"https://github.com/Stonos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-10-25T23:10:57Z","updated_at":"2020-10-25T23:10:57Z","body":"Yes, other than that the stream is playing fine.\r\n\r\nOne thing that is not working correctly however is timeshift. Even with the workaround applied, timeshift was not working correctly (the time was moving too fast and seeking would not seek to the correct position). I had to override the following methods to make timeshift work properly for live streams:\r\n\r\n```kotlin\r\noverride fun seekTo(windowIndex: Int, positionMs: Long) {\r\n    val approximateLiveSeekableRangeStart = remoteMediaClient?.approximateLiveSeekableRangeStart\r\n            ?: 0\r\n    super.seekTo(windowIndex, positionMs + approximateLiveSeekableRangeStart)\r\n}\r\n\r\noverride fun getCurrentPosition(): Long {\r\n    return if (isCurrentWindowLive) { // fix current position on timeshift\r\n        val approximateLiveSeekableRangeStart = remoteMediaClient?.approximateLiveSeekableRangeStart\r\n                ?: 0\r\n        super.getCurrentPosition() - approximateLiveSeekableRangeStart\r\n    } else {\r\n        super.getCurrentPosition()\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n(in order to do that, I modified the original `CastPlayer` class to add a getter for `remoteMediaClient` and made it non-final so that I can extend it)","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/716228356/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Stonos","id":42659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNjU5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos","html_url":"https://github.com/Stonos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/716474133","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7983#issuecomment-716474133","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7983","id":716474133,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcxNjQ3NDEzMw==","user":{"login":"AquilesCanta","id":8539544,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1Mzk1NDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8539544?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta","html_url":"https://github.com/AquilesCanta","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-10-26T11:01:05Z","updated_at":"2020-10-26T11:01:05Z","body":"I think we should incorporate these workarounds (or equivalent changes) to the default implementation. I'll see what I can do about it. My issue right now is that the stream does not play for me.\r\n\r\nWhich application ID are you depending on? \r\n\r\nI'm using the dev branch's \"A12D4273\" app id. If you are not using this one, would you mind trying it out?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/716474133/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"AquilesCanta","id":8539544,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1Mzk1NDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8539544?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta","html_url":"https://github.com/AquilesCanta","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AquilesCanta/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/716493490","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7983#issuecomment-716493490","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7983","id":716493490,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcxNjQ5MzQ5MA==","user":{"login":"Stonos","id":42659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNjU5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos","html_url":"https://github.com/Stonos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stonos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-10-26T11:41:17Z","updated_at":"2020-10-26T11:41:17Z","body":"Just tested app ID `A12D4273` using the Cast demo app on the development branch, and it worked almost fine (the stream started from the beginning instead of the live edge) on a Chromecast 2 and on an Android TV built-in Chromecast.\r\n\r\nThese are the changes I made to the demo app:\r\n```patch\r\nIndex: demos/cast/src/main/java/com/google/android/exoplayer2/castdemo/DemoUtil.java\r\nIDEA additional info:\r\nSubsystem: com.intellij.openapi.diff.impl.patch.CharsetEP\r\n<+>UTF-8\r\n===================================================================\r\n--- demos/cast/src/main/java/com/google/android/exoplayer2/castdemo/DemoUtil.java\t(revision 5b1514e933f1bd7415737af3c2323f47f08f0b64)\r\n+++ demos/cast/src/main/java/com/google/android/exoplayer2/castdemo/DemoUtil.java\t(date 1603711334733)\r\n@@ -41,6 +41,12 @@\r\n     // Clear content.\r\n     samples.add(\r\n         new MediaItem.Builder()\r\n+            .setUri(\"https://live.unified-streaming.com/scte35/scte35.isml/.mpd?dvr_window_length=3600\")\r\n+            .setMediaMetadata(new MediaMetadata.Builder().setTitle(\"Live stream\").build())\r\n+            .setMimeType(MIME_TYPE_DASH)\r\n+            .build());\r\n+    samples.add(\r\n+        new MediaItem.Builder()\r\n             .setUri(\"https://storage.googleapis.com/wvmedia/clear/h264/tears/tears.mpd\")\r\n             .setMediaMetadata(new MediaMetadata.Builder().setTitle(\"Clear DASH: Tears\").build())\r\n             .setMimeType(MIME_TYPE_DASH)\r\nIndex: extensions/cast/src/main/java/com/google/android/exoplayer2/ext/cast/DefaultMediaItemConverter.java\r\nIDEA additional info:\r\nSubsystem: com.intellij.openapi.diff.impl.patch.CharsetEP\r\n<+>UTF-8\r\n===================================================================\r\n--- extensions/cast/src/main/java/com/google/android/exoplayer2/ext/cast/DefaultMediaItemConverter.java\t(revision 5b1514e933f1bd7415737af3c2323f47f08f0b64)\r\n+++ extensions/cast/src/main/java/com/google/android/exoplayer2/ext/cast/DefaultMediaItemConverter.java\t(date 1603711561578)\r\n@@ -62,7 +62,7 @@\r\n     }\r\n     MediaInfo mediaInfo =\r\n         new MediaInfo.Builder(item.playbackProperties.uri.toString())\r\n-            .setStreamType(MediaInfo.STREAM_TYPE_BUFFERED)\r\n+            .setStreamType(MediaInfo.STREAM_TYPE_LIVE)\r\n             .setContentType(item.playbackProperties.mimeType)\r\n             .setMetadata(metadata)\r\n             .setCustomData(getCustomData(item))\r\n```\r\n\r\nI'm not really sure why the stream is not working for you 😕","au