,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDQwNTI4Njk2ODk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/events/4052869689","actor":{"login":"icbaker","id":1279752,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279752?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/icbaker","html_url":"https://github.com/icbaker","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icbaker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icbaker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icbaker/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icbaker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icbaker/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icbaker/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icbaker/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icbaker/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icbaker/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"referenced","commit_id":"9ad70246e6c35b361f7c27d96d76e524f7117ca0","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/commits/9ad70246e6c35b361f7c27d96d76e524f7117ca0","created_at":"2020-11-30T16:35:15Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/815117600","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7983#issuecomment-815117600","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7983","id":815117600,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDgxNTExNzYwMA==","user":{"login":"condesales","id":1881318,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODEzMTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1881318?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/condesales","html_url":"https://github.com/condesales","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/condesales/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/condesales/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/condesales/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/condesales/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/condesales/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/condesales/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/condesales/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/condesales/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/condesales/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-04-07T18:08:48Z","updated_at":"2021-04-07T18:08:48Z","body":"I'm currently observing the same issue on 2.12.1\r\n\r\nI have a custom controls view that extends from the default `PlayerControlView`.\r\nThe controls view then receives a reference for the player via\r\n```kotlin\r\ncontrols.player = player\r\n```\r\nWhere the `player` instance can vary between `SimpleExoPlayer` and `CastPlayer`\r\nFor SimpleExoplayer the controls work fine for either VOD or LIVE but when using the CastPlayer it only works as expected for VOD\r\n\r\nOnce I plugin in a live stream, the `DefaultTimeBar` view does not show duration or position.\r\nCastPlayer.duration always retuns -1000\r\n\r\nI've currently implemented a workaround using `remoteMediaClient.addProgressListener` to receive updates on progress and force update the DefaultTimeBar values using\r\n```kotlin\r\nval duration = remoteMediaClient.approximateLiveSeekableRangeEnd - remoteMediaClient.approximateLiveSeekableRangeStart\r\nval progress = remoteMediaClient.approximateStreamPosition\r\ntimebar.setDuration(duration)\r\ntimebar.setPosition(progress)\r\n```\r\nBut I cannot say I'm very proud of that solution\r\n\r\nThere hasn't been a lot of updates on this issue, so let me know if there's any further information you need to help to solve it.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/815117600/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"condesales","id":1881318,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODEzMTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1881318?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/condesales","html_url":"https://github.com/condesales","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/condesales/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/condesales/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/condesales/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/condesales/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/condesales/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/condesales/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/condesales/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/condesales/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/condesales/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/815122935","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7983#issuecomment-815122935","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7983","id":815122935,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDgxNTEyMjkzNQ==","user":{"login":"condesales","id":1881318,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4ODEzMTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1881318?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/condesales","html_url":"https://github.com/condesales","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/condesales/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/condesales/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/condesales/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/condesales/starred{/owner}{/repo}","sub